{
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><strong>Ask further questions (if relevant) to confirm complaint details, such as:<br /><br /></strong></p>\n<p>&ldquo;Can you tell me more about your concerns?&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&ldquo;I understand that you&rsquo;ve had trouble &lt;accessing/opening&gt; your statements online?&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&ldquo;Can you see the account on your online banking?&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&ldquo;Was there anything else you&rsquo;d like to add about your experience?&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&ldquo;Do you prefer to use the ANZ App or Internet Banking?&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>NOTE:</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>If the customer is experiencing vulnerability or accessibility issues that may affect their ability to receive or read statements, refer to the Knowhow page </em><a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/l3zw9XlBEeakaQBQVpxDEQ?fromMenu=vpZBYpXuEeyRCABQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Supporting Customers Experiencing Vulnerability</em></a> <em>and </em><em>speak to your line manager.</em></li>\n<li><em>If the customer may be eligible for a basic or low fee account but does not have one, refer to the Knowhow page </em><a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/xY1-yBGbEe-RLABQVpUToA?fromMenu=0E4sPBQNEe-RLABQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Basic and Low Fee Accounts</em></a><em>.</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Online statement access issues",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "ConfirmStatement:TalkTrackConfirm:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "dataJSON" : false,
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "textKey" : "",
  "sanitize" : false
}

